{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "ad1af53c291f8713e5f3596e40965078777339fe3deb5bfb3fa41f8c614bb3c2", "ja": "特に、人形が動くシーンが怖かったな～。\nドアノブが突然、ガチャガチャ音を立てて……。", "zh": "人偶动起来的那一幕特别恐怖呢～\n门把突然发出喀嚓喀嚓的声音……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1001_se", "source_sha256": "b03931d3b82ed6cf8b9c49d69cf8ab177345afc7db157eaddd0dd497b2c0c099", "ja": "ガチャガチャガチャッ！", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "9eaf9e29ee97daeec87b7c337346ce77448a75479e8b9138c8646f03c7f3aea9", "ja": "ひゃうあっ！？　……び、びっくりしたぁ。\n{$P$}さんだったんですね。", "zh": "呀啊！？吓、吓了我一跳……\n原来是{$P$}先生啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "982ac660d87a9fea6ca03abaaa5baa61306a3094a9ab0dc961a6a74fad9ab145", "ja": "おはようございます、青羽さん。\nなんだか、ドアの建付けが悪いみたいで……。", "zh": "早安，青羽小姐。\n感觉这个门的开关好像不太顺……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "8f1da8350e3342a6fd88649571a28a82a236c1eeef3b68fabdd1e98642cba5b8", "ja": "そうだったんですか。最近読んだ怪奇小説と\n同じ展開だったから、びっくりしちゃいました。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……情景刚好跟我最近看的\n怪诞小说一样，所以吓到我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "a1e2bc4d315f0de81ca30636bc42ddd1892346db30e4c3288fc185d4b345c893", "ja": "あっ。でも怖いけど雰囲気が素敵で、すごく\n面白かったんです。百合子ちゃんから借りたんですよ！", "zh": "啊，不过，内容虽然恐怖，但营造的氛围很棒，\n非常有意思喔。是百合子借我的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "30011afcf1f081ab7d95262387f850097efddf9dfcfc298754407be22beb1186", "ja": "百合子のオススメでしたか。\nさすが読書家だけあって、色々読んでるんだなぁ。", "zh": "原来是百合子推荐的书啊。\n不愧是爱看书的她，涉猎广泛呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "8f4a5dff6eee05ecfcbdaff9088c518db683d8079808dd5c6d4bab1a2b395faf", "ja": "よかったら、{$P$}さんもぜひ！\n百合子ちゃんと一緒に、感想を語り合いましょう♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生有空的话也请看看！\n我们再找百合子一起分享读后感吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "a82a005c78da23e95ce185d11f2287dedfb4e8ac65fb235b62423d32f28388ab", "ja": "あ、そういえば社長さんから伝言がありましたよ。\n事務所に来てほしいって。", "zh": "啊！对了，社长说他有事要找你，\n希望你去事务所一趟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8c43655d802d5e972c6a02c22e0d9203ce56487dbbfee6bb879e763e3aedbefd", "ja": "社長からですか、ありがとうございます。\nそれじゃ、行ってきますね！", "zh": "社长找我吗？谢谢你的通知。\n那我先过去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "f6c07ea705330e9472378aee4a2b421fa7ff9fa7038c212fdcf16ddb4762f915", "ja": "はーい、行ってらっしゃ～い♪　ドアの建付けは、\n修理のお願いを出しておきますね～！", "zh": "好的～路上小心～♪门的开关问题，\n我会请人来修理的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8ef0e6f23659e0aff427c996c9bbf17bd1ea8d44dbb157dcf64f5ca19ccda5f7", "ja": "おはようございます。……って、うわっ！？\n机に、とんでもない量の書類が積まれて……？", "zh": "早安……咦？哇啊！？\n桌上有堆积如山的文件……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "68d6baa6683ed990525f5ad5bb15408f4f7630ad571255b5ecd2aa42f3c37449", "ja": "よく来てくれたね、君！　いやはや、所属アイドルが\n52人もいると、事務作業の量も膨大でね……。", "zh": "你来了啊！唉呀，旗下偶像多达52位，\n这种行政作业的量自然也会多起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "003d4bf19ff8a69af1c626068a0b37a8980c330f6a9aa9e82b1c9ffa506944f2", "ja": "だが心配はいらない！\n音無君を見たまえ！", "zh": "但你不用担心！\n看看音无吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "516969b6b3ba9038da19d477329b05d88ee93c1a0d48f4835ddfe797a42cb88a", "ja": "しゅばばばばばっ！", "zh": "咻啪啪啪啪啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ef48d0ccf1c6c1dba397c0544aa874c140ba6c471e1c3bedb90656f2c523b479", "ja": "お、音無さんが凄まじい早さで、\n書類を処理していっている……！？", "zh": "音、音无小姐正用惊人的速度\n处理这堆文件……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "9ff4fb9f00e230d0feef220d58d5e65cd9581453daf886a2418c0c91e77e7d8f", "ja": "音無君の事務員としてのスキルには、\n私も驚かされるばかりだよ！", "zh": "音无身为事务员的技能之高超，\n就连我也是惊叹连连啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "972d862a03657e1f88e656c98ff576d51390f495da4ef48353fbf5da1327e499", "ja": "これだけの量の書類をさばけるなんて、\nもしかして私、結構優秀な事務員なんじゃ！？", "zh": "能够处理这么大量的文件，\n我该不会是超级能干的事务员吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "9e243231768af2e3a49b649941b63f71106ac0dca2cee60feb3a20a23e2842c1", "ja": "もしかしなくても、音無さんは\nとても優秀な事務員だと思いますよ！", "zh": "无庸置疑，我觉得音无小姐\n就是非常能干的事务员喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "982f9775f43545bdde470de7457538548aacac1914efa943469fdfdb877c3834", "ja": "いつもおつかれさまです。\nこれ、差し入れのコーヒーです。良かったらどうぞ！", "zh": "一直以来辛苦你了。\n这杯咖啡请你喝，不介意的话就请用吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "257f77e7ee36dcecac78c1ba8e7431ea089272feb97f6b0a42c4fbdd2b79f3c8", "ja": "わぁ、ありがとうございます！\n今日はいつもより頑張れちゃいそうです、うふふ。", "zh": "哇，谢谢你！\n感觉今天能比平时更努力呢，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "d98ab508d995d89008d385312c7430af617579c6cecb1e7ab9426d5c7acd89a4", "ja": "それにしても、本当に多いわ……。\n終わったら、自分へのご褒美を買っちゃおうっと♪", "zh": "话说回来，文件真的好多……\n处理完之后，我也来买些什么犒赏自己好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "09eb55d1ff7ba65252c8b1c00b19aac7341f4f0c0e7d0cb8bffb41b2e1f9dc37", "ja": "（音無さんには、改めて……\nちゃんとした労いを用意するべきだろうな）", "zh": "（感觉自己该好好准备些什么……\n来慰劳这么辛苦的音无小姐才是。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "6bcaef600a30d2c1e27e1c05cf2224a2700db91d288675856857b55e69d3ad9a", "ja": "ところで社長、話というのは……。", "zh": "对了，社长，请问你找我是要……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "58797873edae733dfa9090c61ad31fbf944419c812236f7637ff52450b70fa2f", "ja": "うむ。この前、君が出してくれた企画書だが……。\n実に面白そうなユニットになりそうじゃないか！", "zh": "嗯，关于你之前提出的企划书……\n感觉会是个非常有看头的团体呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "64ef68d7332d8eb476a49b0f643462643e37cabdc3f8fa6a9558eef4efd5db3d", "ja": "七尾百合子君、永吉昴君、伴田路子君、\n真壁瑞希君、望月杏奈君……。", "zh": "七尾百合子、永吉昴、伴田路子、\n真壁瑞希、望月杏奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "279441cdc68aa3d874f7b4702247d8dd85b8419b3f32a7addd5a79c9eebe9a31", "ja": "その5人に退廃的なイメージのユニットを\n組ませるとは、実に斬新な発想だ！", "zh": "让这五人组成颓废风格的团体，\n真是新颖的主意啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "c84d6d0702701fb694d1f168314f3dac07f9871094de8b3eb57883346db16356", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　そろそろ劇場に、\n新しい風を吹かせたいと思っていたんです。", "zh": "谢谢夸奖！我觉得是时候\n让剧场掀起一波新风潮了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "b9b1d01624e957b8f9291202836432be5458a6a9013e2bc7ccf86e7cd2ee6b8c", "ja": "うむ！　君の企画はいつもユニークだが……\nこういう耽美な世界観のものが得意なのかね？", "zh": "嗯！虽然你的企划一直都很独特……\n但你本身熟悉这类唯美的世界观吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "b7827198a25c3501f234f2f48ed9a544a7c1dac99059cf2375afe57de3941d83", "ja": "そういうわけではないと思いますが……\nこういうゴシックな雰囲気は、人気が高いので。", "zh": "说不上熟悉……\n但我觉得这种歌德风，应该会很受欢迎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "de4bbd1047aadde0a0e34308701d16709a98eaae2b625b105183b1db29e1c636", "ja": "今回も、より多くの人に765プロの魅力を伝えて、\n新しいファンを獲得出来たらと思っています！", "zh": "这次我也希望能让更多人知晓765艺能的魅力，\n增加我们的粉丝数量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "78b8bc0e0d1abd97ad74b6b2fde5bc313a4c30ef09167dd318b3693c96f24628", "ja": "うむ！　その意気だよ、君！\nそれでは今回も、よろしく頼んだよ！", "zh": "嗯！就是要有这种决心！\n那这次也拜托你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1033_p", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1034_101kot", "source_sha256": "516969b6b3ba9038da19d477329b05d88ee93c1a0d48f4835ddfe797a42cb88a", "ja": "しゅばばばばばっ！", "zh": "咻啪啪啪啪啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_intro_1035_p", "source_sha256": "ab49735a5fd9273f964f7ac1de4c5a47aac2ee0eef16efb0753101b9f739d141", "ja": "（音無さんも、目いっぱい頑張ってくれている……\n俺もみんなの魅力を最大限引き出してみせるぞ！）", "zh": "（音无小姐也付出所有精神在为我们努力……\n我一定要激发出大家百分之百的魅力！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
